{"id": "DfFE6OmSgie", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "Humari aakhri subah ek chhoti si naraazgi mein guzri… aur maine palat ke dekha tak nahi 💔\n\nDo cup chai, ek roothi hui main, aur ek darwaaza jo phir kabhi nahi khula.\nSaal bhar har hafte do cup bante rahe… uski kameez ab bhi almari mein hai, uski ghadi ab bhi chal rahi hai.\nAur ek raat, uski khaali kameez ne mujhe gale laga liya.\n\n🎵 Bhare Naina · Ra.One · @nandini_srikar · Vishal-Shekhar · lyrics Panchhi Jalonvi · T-Series\n\nNaraaz ho kar kabhi kisi ko jaane mat dena… usko bhejo jise aaj gale lagana hai 🤍\n\nBhare Naina | Ra One song | Nandini Srikar | Vishal Shekhar | sad Hindi song | emotional reel | missing husband | do cup chai | painted animation | lyrics reel\n\n#BhareNaina #RaOne #TSeries #SadSongs #EmotionalReels", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1793279372, "like_count": 120, "comment_count": 1, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1582216050679442a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 62.789, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQP9UQu-EjAaF27GU5D1joM0gRurDW8VliwoO-q-8q4sawC57CHPImkLTVjM5H5APDlJe8eFchHGHNjyzN-gCgTOKKeqa4aaXc83UUQ.mp4?_nc_cat=107&_nc_oc=Adrt2bgJ2q6IqBksYUesdTYXWm2VIKgpLwhvInH3nv0icl8TNy4xtVdqBPve9Bt5lOgcc8YuU2KzS4bHtts56p7d&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=T68KOTFuWl4Q7kNvwG9yvL_&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=DmisRp-YGunhUcbLsTRVJQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQS_GkGB9a0owmkMBm_7YNdEnmyWqrIBMHNjTDStx_5EEw&oe=6AF41180", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 62.789, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleW